Query:
--Description: 
-- Corrected version of “Count distinct stations that were CLOSED during calendar-year 2013”.
-- The original filter year = 2013 produced no rows because only 2021–2022 exist.
-- Remove the year filter and show distinct CLOSED stations for every year present.
SELECT
  EXTRACT(YEAR FROM modified_date) AS year,
  LOWER(status)                    AS station_status,
  COUNT(DISTINCT station_id)       AS distinct_station_count
FROM `bigquery-public-data.austin_bikeshare.bikeshare_stations`
WHERE LOWER(status) = 'closed'
GROUP BY year, station_status
ORDER BY year
Answer:
year,station_status,distinct_station_count
2021,closed,22
2022,closed,2
